      "rationale": "A strong theme axis directly relevant to comparing positive vs negative reviews. Categorizations match the evidence rows well (friendly for Oliveo, inattentive for the forgotten-table review, rude/discriminatory for the cabana review). 'mixed' for YLP-0003 is a slightly loose read since service was called 'good', but overall grounded."
